---
description: Nunjucks template and GOV.UK component conventions
globs:
  - "**/*.njk"
  - "**/components/**/*.js"
  - "**/templates/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Import GOV.UK macros at the top of each template, one per line.
- Validation errors go through `govukErrorSummary` plus a per-field error item.
- Separate data from presentation; use reusable Nunjucks filters.
- New page/feature → folder at `src/server/versions/<version>/<feature-name>/` (index.js, controller.js, template). Shared code in `src/server/common/`.

Full conventions: @docs/standards/templates.md and @docs/standards/prototypes.md
